# Vendored by the package manager; formatting it changes nothing and hides the
# diff that matters.
node_modules

# ⚠️ The lockfile is the package manager's format, not ours.
bun.lock

# ⚠️ Claude Design exports are reference material imported as-is (AGENTS.md):
# reformatting `.dc.html`, `support.js` or the uploads would make every
# re-import a spurious diff. Only the Markdown written here is ours to format.
design/**
!design/*.md

# Symlink to AGENTS.md; formatting the target once is enough.
CLAUDE.md

# Written by Claude Design's GitHub sync and overwritten on every import;
# formatting it only manufactures a diff against the next export.
design/github.md
